    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="welcome-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
        <div class="welcome-faq-header reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Cau hoi thuong gap</p>
            <h2 id="faq-heading">FAQ - Giai dap thac mac</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="welcome-faq__list stagger-children">
            <details class="welcome-faq__item reveal">
                <summary class="welcome-faq__question">QLCM Pro la gi va danh cho ai?</summary>
                <div class="welcome-faq__answer">
                    <p>QLCM Pro la he thong quan ly quy trinh ky thuat chuyen mon toan dien cho benh vien. He thong phuc vu cac doi tuong: Bac si, Dieu duong, Ky thuat vien, Duoc si, Quan tri vien va Lanh dao benh vien.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="welcome-faq__item reveal">
                <summary class="welcome-faq__question">He thong ho tro nhung chuc nang chinh nao?</summary>
                <div class="welcome-faq__answer">
                    <p>QLCM Pro bao gom 6 module chinh: Quan ly quy trinh ky thuat, Thiet lap phan quyen RBAC, Dieu chinh phan quyen, Ban hanh quy trinh, Danh muc ky thuat va dinh muc, Phac do lam sang theo ICD.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="welcome-faq__item reveal">
                <summary class="welcome-faq__question">QLCM Pro co tich hop duoc voi HIS (Hospital Information System) khong?</summary>
                <div class="welcome-faq__answer">
                    <p>QLCM Pro ho tro tich hop voi cac he thong HIS thong qua API RESTful. Tinh nang tich hop HL7 FHIR dang duoc phat trien trong lo trinh san pham.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="welcome-faq__item reveal">
                <summary class="welcome-faq__question">Du lieu benh vien co duoc bao mat nhu the nao?</summary>
                <div class="welcome-faq__answer">
                    <p>He thong ap dung bao mat du lieu bang ma hoa tien tien, audit trail bat bien (khong the chinh sua/xoa), phan quyen chi tiet theo vai tro, va tuan thu quy dinh bao mat du lieu y te Viet Nam.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="welcome-faq__item reveal">
                <summary class="welcome-faq__question">Quy trinh trien khai QLCM Pro nhu the nao?</summary>
                <div class="welcome-faq__answer">
                    <p>QLCM Pro ho tro ca 2 hinh thuc: on-premise (tai cho) va cloud. Doi ngu chuyen gia se dong hanh tu giai doan khao sat, cau hinh he thong, di chuyen du lieu, den dao tao nguoi dung va van hanh.</p>
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
